 alarm description goes through regulatory review.</p>\n<div class=\"callout note\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Note:</strong> Text of the note.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout tip\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Tip:</strong> A helpful shortcut or good practice.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout important\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Important:</strong> Something the reader must not miss.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Warning:</strong> A risk of damage to equipment or data.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout caution\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Caution:</strong> A risk of injury.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"procedure\">\n  <h4 dir=\"auto\" id=\"h-to-do-this\">To do this</h4>\n  <ol class=\"l-dec\">\n    <li dir=\"auto\">First step.</li>\n    <li dir=\"auto\">Second step.</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"result\" dir=\"auto\"><em>Result:</em> what the reader sees.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"prereq\">\n  <h4 dir=\"auto\" id=\"h-before-you-begin\">Before you begin</h4>\n  <ul class=\"check\">\n    <li dir=\"auto\">Prerequisite</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa\">\n  <p class=\"q\" dir=\"auto\">Question</p>\n  <p class=\"a\" dir=\"auto\">Answer</p>\n</div>\n<dl>\n  <dt dir=\"auto\">Term</dt>\n  <dd dir=\"auto\">Definition</dd>\n</dl>\n<table class=\"t-firstcol t-plain\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td dir=\"auto\">Field</td>\n      <td dir=\"auto\"><br></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td dir=\"auto\">Field</td>\n      <td dir=\"auto\"><br></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNk+A8AAQUBAScY42YAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 25%\">\n  <figcaption dir=\"auto\">Figure caption</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><br></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"DG\"><i><u>hey world</u></i></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"ts\">[03:45]</span>&nbsp;18 Oct 2026</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><summary dir=\"auto\">Section title (click to