ut 40 seconds before BIT starts.</p><p class=\"q\" dir=\"auto\">Which BIT results stop the operator?</p><p class=\"a\" dir=\"auto\">Any red result on the transmitter or the cooling loop. Amber results are logged and the operator may continue. <mark class=\"fu\">Get the full list of amber codes from Yossi.</mark></p></div><h1 dir=\"auto\">Procedures described</h1><ol><li dir=\"auto\"><br></li></ol><h1 dir=\"auto\">Terminology</h1><p dir=\"auto\"><br></p><h1 dir=\"auto\">Follow-ups</h1><ul class=\"check\"><li dir=\"auto\"><br></li></ul>"}],"snippets":[{"id":"snip-pgjbl2q","name":"CAUTION","html":"<div class=\"callout caution\"><p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Caution:</strong> A risk of injury.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"procedure\">\n  <h4 dir=\"auto\"></h4></div>","authorId":"u-tamir","createdAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:14.239Z"}],"libraryImported":true}